      "description": "<h2>Brother TZe-231 Black on White Tape Cartridge</h2><p style=\"text-align: justify; \">The Brother TZE-231 Black on White Tape Cartridge is 12mm in width. The tape measures 8 meters in length. The Brother TZE-231 Black on White Tape Cartridge is Guaranteed to provide you with labels that are bright, sharp, and easy to read for a long time. Its equally useful in the home, office, or business for identifying the contents of everything from file folders and shelves to USB flash drives, cables, and other equipment. These self-adhesive laminated labels are resistant to chemicals, abrasion, sunlight, and submersion in water, making them excellent for both indoor and outdoor usage. Genuine Brother TZe-231 Black on White Tap Cartridge is simple to install and comes in a variety of label widths, colors, and materials to ensure that your P-touch machine can handle all of your labeling demands. This Brother TZE-231 Cartridge has no warranty.</p>",
